{"id":"groningen","name":"格罗宁根","en":"Groningen","country":"Netherlands","lat":53.2189,"lng":6.5675,"dek":"学生、单车与北方低地的旧城","history":"格罗宁根最早见于文字记载是在11世纪，但地下遗存把人类活动上推至史前。三世纪前后，这里出现第一个主要聚落。到13世纪，它已成为区域贸易中心，筑起城墙，影响力向外辐射，格罗宁根方言也随之成为周边的主要语言。15世纪末是这座城市话语权最重的时期，邻近的弗里斯兰一度由它管理，马提尼塔也在这一时期立起，成为天际线上最醒目的坐标。\n\n16世纪的八十年战争中，格罗宁根先站在西班牙一边，1594年转而加入荷兰共和国。1614年，格罗宁根大学成立，最初为宗教教育而设，此后逐渐成为北方学术的重心。1672年第三次英荷战争期间，明斯特主教伯恩哈德·冯·加伦猛攻城池，城墙挡住了攻势，这场解围至今仍被当地人年年纪念。\n\n二战没有放过这里。1945年4月的格罗宁根战役持续数日，主广场格罗特市场受损严重，但马提尼塔、马提尼教堂、高坎图尔和市政厅都幸存下来。战后城市在旧肌理上重建，老仓库、教堂与战后新建筑并置，形成今天中心城区层层叠叠的面貌。","culture":"格罗宁根不大，却是荷兰北方实打实的都会。大量学生让城市的文化底色偏年轻：音乐、戏剧、展览的节奏跟着学期走，广场在周四和周五夜里尤其拥挤，部分酒吧开到清晨。2006年它被评为荷兰最佳市中心，理由多半与这种松弛而密集的日常有关。\n\n博物馆是另一条线索。格罗宁根博物馆由亚历山大·门蒂尼设计，建筑本身就常被当作展品谈论，是荷兰最现代也最具实验性的馆舍之一。城中还有科学博物馆、漫画博物馆和烟草博物馆，规模都不大。2019年开幕的格罗宁根论坛文化中心把图书馆、电影院和博物馆的一部分叠在一处，成了市民日常穿行的公共客厅。","pull":"城墙挡过炮火，学生占满广场。","sights":[{"name":"马提尼塔","orig":"Martinitoren","intro":"格罗宁根的天际线标志，立于格罗特市场一侧，与马提尼教堂相连。现存塔身完成于15世纪，高约97米，是荷兰最高的教堂尖塔之一。登塔可俯瞰旧城与运河网。战时周边广场损毁严重，塔却幸存，因此当地人看它不只是一座钟楼。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Martini_Toren.JPG/960px-Martini_Toren.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1784},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A9%AC%E6%8F%90%E5%B0%BC%E5%A1%94"},{"name":"格罗特市场","orig":"Grote Markt","intro":"城市心脏地带的开放广场，马提尼塔、市政厅等建筑围合四周。1945年4月的战役中这一带受损最重，战后重建让广场呈现出新旧混杂的层次。平日是市集与行人往来的场所，入夜后成为学生聚集的区域，周边酒吧密集。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/20100523_Grote_Markt_en_Martinitoren_Groningen_NL.jpg/960px-20100523_Grote_Markt_en_Martinitoren_Groningen_NL.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":561},"src":null},{"name":"格罗宁根博物馆","orig":"Groninger Museum","intro":"由意大利建筑师亚历山大·门蒂尼设计，建筑由几块色彩与材质各异的体量拼在一起，落成后一直是荷兰最具争议也最受关注的馆舍之一。馆藏涵盖北方艺术、设计与当代作品。很多人来此先看建筑，再进厅看展，两者难以分开。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Groninger_Museum_2.jpg/960px-Groninger_Museum_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":418},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A0%BC%E7%BE%85%E5%AF%A7%E6%A0%B9%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"},{"name":"格罗宁根论坛文化中心","orig":"Forum Groningen","intro":"2019年11月开幕的复合文化建筑，把图书馆、电影院和格罗宁根博物馆的一部分收进同一栋楼。内部是层层退台的开放空间，屋顶平台可眺望城市。它不像传统文化中心那样庄重，更像一处被市民日常使用的公共客厅，工作日也人来人往。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Forum_aan_de_Nieuwe_Markt.jpg/960px-Forum_aan_de_Nieuwe_Markt.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":844},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forum_Groningen"},{"name":"欧罗堡球场","orig":"Euroborg","intro":"格罗宁根足球俱乐部的主场，2006年初正式启用，可容纳两万余名观众。球场不在老城中心，而是城市东南侧的新区，外观方正，比赛日人流向此汇聚。它接替了旧的主场奥斯特帕克球场，也成为这座城市现代体育生活的一个坐标。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Euroborg.jpg/960px-Euroborg.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AD%90%E7%BE%85%E5%A0%A1%E7%90%83%E5%A0%B4"}],"foods":[{"name":"格罗宁根香肠","orig":"Groninger worst","intro":"用生猪肉糜灌制后风干而成的香肠，是本地最有代表性的肉食。口感偏硬、咸香耐嚼，通常切片直接吃，配面包或作下酒小食。超市和肉铺都能买到，讲究的会挑手工灌制、风干时间更长的版本。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"蛋球","orig":"eierbal","intro":"格罗宁根版的炸肉丸：把整颗水煮蛋裹上肉馅与面包糠，下锅炸至外壳金黄。切开时蛋黄与肉汁混在一起，是当地小吃店的常驻品，常被视作荷兰可乐饼在格罗宁根的变体。趁热吃，配芥末。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Eierbal.jpg/960px-Eierbal.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":541},"src":null},{"name":"格罗宁根芥末","orig":"Groninger mosterd","intro":"荷兰北方常见的调味芥末，格罗宁根出产的版本以颗粒感和辛香见长。颜色偏黄褐，质地较粗，常与香肠、奶酪或炖菜同食。当地超市与酱料铺有售，是能带走的本地味道。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Groninger_Mosterd_at_Meinardi%2C_Winschoten_%282018%29.jpg/960px-Groninger_Mosterd_at_Meinardi%2C_Winschoten_%282018%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":540},"src":null},{"name":"荷兰奶酪","orig":"kaas","intro":"格罗宁根的奶酪铺延续荷兰的奶酪传统，卖本地与有机品种，如青酱奶酪和农家碎酪。可以按块称重，请店家切一小片先尝。市中心的老街上有几家经营多年的铺子，适合买一小块配面包当路上吃食。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/Cheese_platter.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":576},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheese"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Groninger_Forum_-_panorama_%2814%29.jpg/1280px-Groninger_Forum_-_panorama_%2814%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Hoge_der_Aa2.jpg/1280px-Hoge_der_Aa2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":851}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[6.4627456,53.2019788],[6.4634614,53.2000582],[6.4857168,53.2038213],[6.4925926,53.2013861],[6.4931641,53.1987783],[6.4942271,53.1982175],[6.5068593,53.200144],[6.513386,53.196937],[6.5157152,53.1983082],[6.530492,53.1955593],[6.5294927,53.1951862],[6.5342122,53.1841781],[6.5396562,53.1812216],[6.5417439,53.1786103],[6.5569357,53.1838305],[6.5581876,53.1820398],[6.5667014,53.1845367],[6.5718188,53.1827417],[6.5806358,53.1832338],[6.5797218,53.1846846],[6.5811563,53.1849674],[6.5810381,53.1858777],[6.5987135,53.1905608],[6.5958923,53.1949272],[6.6044687,53.1965916],[6.6389183,53.1857844],[6.6468213,53.1879374],[6.6400057,53.1904088],[6.6426114,53.1918823],[6.6499791,53.193177],[6.6668727,53.2020203],[6.6487855,53.217262],[6.6435024,53.2267307],[6.6407107,53.2288504],[6.6433133,53.2305132],[6.641089,53.2311061],[6.6400482,53.2324727],[6.6436564,53.233464],[6.6436217,53.2350556],[6.6350434,53.2512847],[6.619297,53.2494479],[6.6183458,53.2514859],[6.6064072,53.2514166],[6.6063513,53.2537408],[6.5863277,53.2558461],[6.5886933,53.2625509],[6.5857788,53.2624915],[6.5857523,53.2615399],[6.5672301,53.2614941],[6.5666012,53.2636074],[6.552397,53.2621786],[6.5495519,53.264409],[6.5502631,53.2649469],[6.5409666,53.2636236],[6.5379262,53.2640967],[6.539308,53.2603597],[6.5342663,53.2600604],[6.5303096,53.2582381],[6.526594,53.2582658],[6.5242915,53.2564362],[6.5190544,53.2584892],[6.5108253,53.2567879],[6.5082404,53.2575741],[6.508571,53.2558554],[6.5114424,53.2541142],[6.5090057,53.2530744],[6.5026359,53.247501],[6.4992363,53.2483833],[6.4959885,53.2456114],[6.4919855,53.2455547],[6.4924358,53.2466747],[6.4887255,53.2472314],[6.4886017,53.2490164],[6.4809207,53.2501853],[6.480195,53.2443606],[6.4738044,53.2316221],[6.4743531,53.2308282],[6.4644736,53.2076143],[6.4670036,53.2061704],[6.4668996,53.2043024],[6.4627456,53.2019788]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"格罗宁根","en":"Groningen","voyage":"Groningen"}}}